  "transcriber_notes": [
   "Rows: 18 in the year part (昭和3-8年度 x 總數/本科/補習科) and 14 in the 地方別 part (總數 x3, 臺北/新竹/臺中/臺南/高雄 x 本科+補習科, 花蓮港 本科 only) = 32 rows.",
   "Row labels: 年度 printed 昭和 3 then ditto marks (〃) for 4-8, written here as '同'; the small 年度 above the first year is not repeated. In the 地方別 part 州 rows carry only 本科 and 補習科 (no 總數 line).",
   "The columns 學校, 敎員 (all five) and 學校一ニ付 / 敎員一ニ付 are printed once per brace group (on the 本科 line, i.e. the vertical middle of the group); they are entered here on the first row of each group (總數 row, or 本科 row for 州) and left empty on the other rows.",
   "Teacher cells: a '×' (兼務, concurrent) with a small figure beneath the main figure is written '209 ×24' = 209 teachers of whom 24 are 兼務 (footnote ×ハ兼務). Row 臺南, 敎員 無資格 內地人: only '×' and a small '11' are printed with no main figure, written '×11' (main figure absent in print). The small figures of 臺南 sum to the printed '×12' (11+1), and the 臺南 teacher total 47 = 45+1+1 without it; this is a layout reading, not an arithmetic fix.",
   "Column 生徒 — 學校一ニ付 / 敎員一ニ付 are the printed per-school and per-teacher pupil averages (shown as integers, no decimals).",
   "Printed frame p0079 only; the right page (p. 111) columns 外國人 (現在) through 敎員一ニ付 are read from the right half of the spread.",
   "Checks (python3): every 總數 cell (現在, 入學, 卒業) equals 內地人+本島人+蕃人+外國人 in all 32 rows; 本科+補習科 = 總數 in all 7 groups for all 15 pupil columns; the 州 rows sum to the 總數 group (本科 and 補習科, all 15 pupil columns); 學校 4+1+2+3+2+1 = 13; teacher columns sum to the 總數 line (225/207/2/8/8); each teacher 總數 = 有資格+無資格 in all 12 rows; small 兼務 figures of the 州 sum to 18 (5+1+12), and per-row small figures sum to the printed total ×. All reconcile.",
   "No unreadable cells."
  ],
